ui: AUTOMATION + ADD CHANCE: step 4's CHANCE 50 %, nothing else; its row selected ok
ui:   KNOB 4 the CHANCE, KNOB 2 moves it to the next step (the old one back to 100 %) ok
ui:   SAVE held: the move undone (the sound and LEN untouched); held again: redone ok
ui:   at 100 % it stays listed while edited; another row picked: gone (nothing stored) ok
ui: AUTOMATION RATCH: + ADD x2, KNOB 4 to x4, EDIT x1; each one undo (SAVE held), the step's flags only ok
ui:   the rows: PLAY, QUANTIZE, by step (CHANCE, RATCH, NUDGE, then its locks / events), + ADD; one there: ALREADY LISTED ok
ui:   EDIT on the NUDGE row: back to 0                                         ok
ui:   while a song plays: STOP TO EDIT, nothing changes                        ok
